  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "13",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now using the property&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now adding above equations we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now using the property&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mtext>when&#160;</mtext><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mtext>&#160;is&#160;even</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now adding equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math>,</p><p>Now on comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math>, we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p>",
